Third-party material vendored under this directory
==================================================

Everything below `fixtures/upstream/` is copied from the upstream bpfix project
and is not original to bpfix-adversarial. It is redistributed here so that the
evaluation can be reproduced against a fixed upstream tree.

    Upstream:  eunomia-bpf/bpfix
               https://github.com/eunomia-bpf/bpfix
    Pin:       81d97e4a528456e0082a77f4fb6edd13fa092b7b (2026-07-11)
    Paper:     Zheng et al., arXiv:2607.02748
    License:   MIT

Vendored material:

    bpfix-source-rs-pin/source.rs       upstream source-comment heuristics
    bpfix-source-rs-pin/classifier.rs   upstream error-ID to obligation map
    bpfix-bench-cases/                  21 benchmark cases (program sources,
                                        diagnostics, verifier logs, metadata)
    main75_case_index.json              case index
    main75_upstream_diagnostics.json    error IDs and diagnostic hashes
    depth21_manifest.json               fetch manifest for the 21-case subset

